description:
Please note that this is not a call for tenders but a publication announcing the Contracting authority’s intention to publish a future negotiated low or middle valueprocedure. 
DG Environment services seek for scientific, legal and technical support in the implementation of the Persistent Organic Pollutants (POPs) Regulation and in the implementation of the Stockholm Convention, in particular with regard to:
- the preparation of EU nominations of new POP candidates to the Stockholm Convention, including attendance of relevant meetings under the Convention;
- the preparation of guidance for the implementation of the POPs Regulation;
- the setting of unintentional trace contaminant (UTC) limit values for certain chemicals under the POPs Regulation;
